      226   end.
      227       define buffer doc-pl-pump-attr for ub.doc-pl-pump-attr.
      228   on delete of ub.doc-pl-pump-attr override do: end.
      229   for each doc-pl-pump-attr exclusive-lock
      230       where doc-pl-pump-attr.obj-type  = doc-pl-pump.obj-type
      231             and doc-pl-pump-attr.obj-code  = doc-pl-pump.obj-code
      232             and doc-pl-pump-attr.pl-code   = doc-pl-pump.pl-code
      233             and doc-pl-pump-attr.pump-code = doc-pl-pump.pump-code
      234             and doc-pl-pump-attr.out-code  = doc-pl-pump.out-code
      235             and doc-pl-pump-attr.gds-code  = doc-pl-pump.gds-code
      236   on error undo, return error
